---
import OceanLayout from '../layouts/OceanLayout.astro';
import releases from '../data/releases.json';
const release = releases.find((item) => item.slug === "letme")!;
const songUrl = 'https://streetvoice.com/murmurband_/songs/707009/';
---
<OceanLayout title={release.title + ' · Murmur'}>
  <main id="page-content" tabindex="-1" class="lyrics-page">
    <aside class="record-panel">
      <a class="back-link" lang="en" href="/works.html">← All works</a>
      <a class="record-cover-link" href={songUrl} aria-label={release.title + ' — 聆聽歌曲'}>
        <img class="record-cover" src={release.image} alt={release.title + ' 封面'} />
      </a>
      <p class="record-title"><a href={songUrl}>{release.title}</a></p>
      {release.english !== release.title && <p class="record-name" lang="en">{release.english}</p>}
      <p class="eyebrow">{release.date}</p>
      <div class="st_composer">作詞・作曲：盧瑞珍／施柏年</div>
      <div class="st_artist">
            編曲 Arranger｜施柏年 Marcus Shih
            <br>主唱 Vocalist｜盧瑞珍 Jane Lu
            <br>木吉他 Acoustic Guitarist｜施柏年 Marcus Shih
            <br>木箱鼓 Cajonist｜施柏年 Marcus Shih
            <br>
            <br>
        </div>
    </aside>
    <article class="lyrics-content">
<div class = st> 
        <h1><a class="st_title" href={songUrl}>{release.title}</a></h1>   
           
        <div class="st_text">
            陽光灑落每片車窗
            <br>對著窗外風景想像
            <br>把懞懂裝進行李踏向了遠方    
            <br>嚮往
            <br>
            <br>陌生卻又好奇
            <br>像是對未知不在意
            <br>在鏡子面前 反覆說服自己
            <br>必須獨立
            <br>
            <br>They were talking too much 說你不一樣
            <br>但是不一樣 才夠瘋狂
            <br>你擁有特別的力量
            <br>在這座城市闖蕩
            <br>They were talking too much 說你不一樣
            <br>但是不一樣 才是解答
            <br>讓我擁抱你所有的模樣
            <br>
            <br>終於還是來到這裡
            <br>顫抖的心像在回應
            <br>多少次懷疑 卻依舊任性
            <br>再繼續
            <br>
            <br>They were talking too much 說你不一樣
            <br>但是不一樣 才夠瘋狂
            <br>你擁有特別的力量
            <br>在這座城市闖蕩
            <br>They were talking too much 說你不一樣
            <br>但是不一樣 才是解答
            <br>讓我擁抱你所有的模樣
            <br>
            <br>想要得到誰的肯定
            <br>想要成為怎樣的自己
            <br>雨過就會天晴 聽見你的聲音
            <br>
            <br>我怕我不一樣 太不一樣
            <br>世界太複雜 有太多變化
            <br>全新的開始 我準備好了嗎
            <br>會不會受傷 會不會徬徨
            <br>未來會怎樣 會遇見哪個他
            <br>哪裡才是奔馳的方向
            <br>
            <br>They were talking too much 說你不一樣
            <br>但是不一樣 才夠瘋狂
            <br>你擁有特別的力量
            <br>在這座城市闖蕩
            <br>They were talking too much 說你不一樣
            <br>但是不一樣 才是解答
            <br>讓我擁抱你所有的模樣
            <br>
            <br>           
        </div>
           
    </div>
      <a class="back-link lyrics-back" lang="en" href="/works.html">← All works</a>
    </article>
  </main>
</OceanLayout>
